  "title": "ThreadX support for STM32CubeMX2",
  "content": "<p>I see the USBX/FileX/LevelX middlewares are supported in STM32CubeMX2, but ThreadX (formerly AzureRTOS, formerly ThreadX) itself is not? Is ThreadX support on the roadmap for the STM32C5 series? I really don’t want to have to go back to using FreeRTOS.</p>",
